<title>HONG KONG: Tem Fat Hing Fung year net up 4.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Tem Fat Hing Fung year net up 4.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended April 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.33	vs 9.81</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0	  vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  53.81 gain vs 81.27 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    106.06     vs 101.33</p>
<p>    Turnover		     6,679.83   vs 7,047.84</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tem Fat Hing Fung (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 18-20</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 31</p>
<p>NOTE - Tem Fat Hing Fung is a bullion, jewellery and property company.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$58.82 million on partial disposal of subsidiary companies and loss of HK$5.01 million on provision for diminution in value of other inestments.</p>
<p>Share earnings are based on net after preference dividend of HK$101.45 million vs HK$96.73 million and on the weighted average of 981.95 million shares vs 986.42 million.</p>
<p>Total ordinary dividend for year is four H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent) vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
